  "details": "SDK3 Avatar 2021.03.09.13.58 (occurred before probably)\nImpact: The workaround is simple but not obvious. I suggest at least mentioning in the documentation.\nDescription of the bug:\nIf there are multiple Avatars in the scene and at least one of them is not Quest compatible, the Build & Publish button is grayed out unless all non-quest avatar objects in the scene are deactivated.\nSteps to reproduce:\nHave an avatar project with multiple Avatars and have one of them Quest Compatible and one not (e.g. select a non-standard shader). Now, although you can select the correct avatar in the build panel and it shows no inhibiting errors, the button is grayed out.",
